  "kind": "route",
  "responsibility": "Lists the repositories the navigator shows and chooses a repository's checkout for the whole machine; the workbench's registry follow then moves the panes",
  "description": "GET /api/repositories answers under the settings-read browser-origin guard; PUT /api/repositories/chosen {repository, root} answers under the mutation guard, as the opener settings do. Neither names a vault, because the list and the choice belong to the machine. A root that is not a known checkout of the repository is refused (CHECKOUT_UNKNOWN, 404): the page offers nothing else, and the route never registers one. A choice, even of the checkout chosen already, calls the workbench's followRegistry; the workbench watches the registry file for every other change (TASK-653.09).",
